    {
      "name": "Ramming Speed",
      "actions": 2,
      "traits": [],
      "description": "<p>The whalesteed Swims twice and then makes a snout Strike. As long as it moved at least 20 feet, it gains a +1 circumstance bonus to its attack roll. A Large or smaller creature hit by this attack must succeed at a DC 16 Fortitude save or be Slowed 1 for 1 round.</p>",
      "collapsed": false
    }
  ],
  "spellcastingEntries": [],
  "description": "<p>Whalesteeds were first tamed in the Shackles as part of an ambush between rival pirate captains. Whalesteed riders are still an unusual sight, as learning to master the skill takes years of training.</p>",
